    "b-ks2-path-epoch-intro": {
      "id": "b-ks2-path-epoch-intro",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Drift review runs inside pr_imported, run_closed, and drift_recheck passes. Report reconciliation preserves rename continuity and mechanical re-anchoring refreshes citations whose code is unchanged. The librarian reviews flagged meaning or missing code; its consumer releases unresolved drift once and records a warning if the retry still leaves drift. Manual kg2-drift-scan enqueues flagged subjects by unit, with individual tasks for unit-less entities. Accepted librarian follow-ups enqueue individual drift_recheck tasks with a reason. Batches over 12 subjects split at claim time. The former dedicated epoch-boundary librarian phase is historical; current boundaries still run shared knowledge intake."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
